  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your spells have lives of their own.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Lingering Spell<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you cast a spell augmented with Lingering Spell, you cause an instantaneous spell that affects an area to persist for 2 rounds. Those already in the area suffer no additional harm, but other creatures or objects entering the area are subject to its effects. A Lingering spell with a visual manifestation obscures vision, providing concealment (20% miss chance) beyond 5 feet and total concealment (50% miss chance) beyond 20 feet. On your next turn, as a move action you can have the location of the spell move up to 5 feet per mythic tier.</p>\n<p>Alternatively, you may expend a use of mythic power to cast a spell as a Lingering spell (gaining only the normal benefits of a Lingering spell, rather than the increased benefits outlined above) without preparing it as Lingering in advance, taking extra casting time, or increasing the level of spell slot it uses.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-metamagic-feats#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
